{"id":"geo-xiangyang","cat":"geography","type":"城市","name":"襄阳","era":"南宋","year":1267,"endYear":null,"ptype":null,"birth":null,"death":null,"summary":"汉水重镇，南宋京西南路治所；1267—1273 年被元军围困六年，城破则临安门户洞开。","tags":["襄阳","汉水","围城"],"groups":[],"minor":false,"detail":"襄阳与樊城夹汉水对峙，为控扼荆襄、通达江汉的枢纽。宋元战争中元军筑堡连营、断其援路，守将吕文焕坚守六年后出降。襄阳既失，元军顺汉入江，直取鄂州、临安。","body":null,"refs":"《宋史·度宗纪》《宋史·吕文焕传》","categoryName":"地理邦交","createdAt":"2026-11-06 09:09:35","updatedAt":"2026-11-06 09:09:35","related":[{"id":"geo-ezhou","name":"鄂州","cat":"geography"},{"id":"geo-jinghubei","name":"荆湖北路","cat":"geography"},{"id":"mil-changjiang","name":"长江防线","cat":"military"},{"id":"mil-xiangfan","name":"襄樊之战","cat":"military"},{"id":"ppl-lvwenhuan","name":"吕文焕","cat":"people"},{"id":"tl-1267","name":"襄阳被围","cat":"timeline"},{"id":"tl-1273","name":"襄阳陷落","cat":"timeline"}],"sources":[]}